+        Both fields are required; no email, real name, or phone number is needed.
+      </p>
+      <p>
+        When you select {registering ? 'Sign Up' : 'Sign In'}, your username and password
+        are sent over HTTPS to the external DevTools Times demo authentication service
+        at <span className="break-all">us-central1-web-devrel-apps.cloudfunctions.net</span>
+        {' '}to {registering ? 'create your demo account' : 'check your credentials'}.
+        The service also receives your IP address and standard request information.
+      </p>
+      <p>
+        The form clears your password after each attempt and does not save credentials
+        or tokens in browser storage. The external service’s retention and deletion
+        practices have not been verified.{' '}
+        <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}legal/privacy`} className="underline">
+          Read about data use
+        </a>.
+      </p>
+    </aside>
+  );
+}
